&lt;p&gt;One GitHub issue turned into an extension sprint. 32 new additions, 504 in total, say a lot about where PostgreSQL is headed. &lt;a href="https://vonng.com/en/pg/extension-504/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read more&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>